"Hui Jaotzu is a hidden village where three Blaze Bear territories meet, shielded by rivers."
"A golden pool of spilled blood-Qi bubbles at the ruined heart of the Ash Forest."
"Soon demon hornets erupt from the forest's edge and overrun the Ash Forest within about a year."
"Hui Jaotzu villager Yi Baolin will be nearly killed by hornet stings and revived by Ri Zu."
"The Blaze Bear Huishou will nickname his human friend Yi Baolin \"Stick Human\"."
"After the hornet war, Shady Glade becomes the Blaze Bears' human ally."
"With Qi restored after the war, the trees will regrow to towering size over two centuries."
"After the hornet war, no bees survive within a hundred li of the Ash Forest."
"Hornets that drink the Ash Forest's golden blood-pool grow monstrous and can turn unstable."
"A bison mutated by the pool grew ruby antlers and fire-blood, torching 20 li of grass."
"A groundhog mutated by the pool grew crystal spines it implants to control other groundhogs."
"Demon hornets grow as long as a hand and can strip an area of all life."
"Demon hornets can weave a false-sky illusion to hide a huge approaching swarm."
"Pine-needle smoke slows and stupefies demon hornets and can put them to sleep."
"The Yellow Empress is a hornet queen mutated by drinking dragon-vein Qi and lightning."
"The Yellow Empress grows larger than a Blaze Bear, with six wings and bear-paw-like arms."
"Soon the Yellow Empress's swarm takes most of the Ash Forest and fights Fa Ram's forces."
